      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design ATM (Automated Teller Machine)\n- Insert a card\n- authenticate using pin\n- perform operations like cash withdrawal, deposit and balance inquiry\n- One transaction per session\n- Inventory of cash by denomination\n- Machine should try to dispense the higher available denominations first\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design ATM (Automated Teller Machine)\n- Insert a card\n- authenticate using pin\n- perform operations like cash withdrawal, deposit and balance inquiry\n- One transaction per session\n- Inventory of cash by denomination\n- Machine should try to dispense the higher available denominations first\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
